# ==========================================================================
# Aither — ignored paths
# ==========================================================================

# Compiled server binary. `go build -o aither .` produces the lower-case name,
# a bare `go build .` uses the module name instead.
/aither
/Aither

# Go build, test and coverage artefacts
*.exe
*.exe~
*.test
*.out
*.prof

# Local SQLite database. The default lives outside the repository
# (~/.aither/aither.db), but `./aither -db ./aither.db` keeps it here.
*.db
*.db-wal
*.db-shm

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
